<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia to sign $500 mln standby loan agreement.</title>
<headline>Indonesia to sign $500 mln standby loan agreement.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's Central Bank Governor Sudradjad Djiwandono said on Monday the country will sign a $500 million standby loan agreement on Tuesday with a syndicate of 40 foreign banks to strengthen foreign exchange reserves.</p>
</text>
